675
00:23:57.934 --> 00:23:58.835
So lazy loading can

676
00:23:59.218 --> 00:24:01.859
dramatically reduce the initial image pull time

677
00:24:01.879 --> 00:24:02.279
with Soci.

678
00:24:02.659 --> 00:24:05.280
But if the first file access need to fetch data

679
00:24:05.300 --> 00:24:07.160
over the network, some of that time may come

680
00:24:07.200 --> 00:24:07.620
back later.

681
00:24:08.441 --> 00:24:10.061
So it's not just about container starts,

682
00:24:10.101 --> 00:24:11.802
but when the application can actually do work

683
00:24:11.842 --> 00:24:13.522
and how fast that application work is.

684
00:24:15.283 --> 00:24:18.083
We also verified which snapshot Fargate is

685
00:24:18.164 --> 00:24:18.344
using.

686
00:24:18.384 --> 00:24:21.284
So we're checking Soci versus overlay FS.

687
00:24:21.645 --> 00:24:23.185
So we know Soci is really active.

688
00:24:24.646 --> 00:24:26.027
When we talk about the different tool links,

689
00:24:26.067 --> 00:24:28.289
some of it is not quite clear how to get

