00:24:29.990 --> 00:24:32.533
And so we're also just verifying that the build

692
00:24:32.553 --> 00:24:35.135
process we're using is doing what we expect for

693
00:24:35.155 --> 00:24:35.655
the benchmark.

694
00:24:36.276 --> 00:24:37.817
So this repository, which you can access,

