00:26:01.022 --> 00:26:02.403
was actually a bit slower than

733
00:26:03.217 --> 00:26:05.319
Soci alone, 17.5 seconds.

734
00:26:05.439 --> 00:26:08.481
So that I think is interesting.

735
00:26:08.581 --> 00:26:10.442
For the small image, uncompressed,

736
00:26:10.504 --> 00:26:12.243
19 seconds startup time.

737
00:26:13.344 --> 00:26:16.226
With Soci, 13 seconds.

738
00:26:16.346 --> 00:26:18.147
gzip actually just makes it slower for small

739
00:26:18.187 --> 00:26:18.347
image.

740
00:26:18.387 --> 00:26:19.228
We get 20 seconds.

741
00:26:19.708 --> 00:26:21.109
And if you combine gzip with SOCI,

742
00:26:21.650 --> 00:26:22.430
it's kind of in the middle.

743
00:26:22.951 --> 00:26:26.453
It's better than just gzip alone, but not as

744
00:26:26.493 --> 00:26:28.254
good as Soci on its own with an uncompressed

745
00:26:28.314 --> 00:26:28.534
image.

746
00:26:28.855 --> 00:26:31.396
So you can see the varying effects of combining

747
00:26:31.436 --> 00:26:32.397
compression with Soci.

748
00:26:32.993 --> 00:26:34.734
Again, your mileage will vary.

749
00:26:34.754 --> 00:26:36.255
This is our image, our context.

750
00:26:36.315 --> 00:26:38.676
A lot of these dependencies might have already

